e-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"><span><strong class=\"source-question-number\">24</strong><strong class=\"source-question-number\">25</strong> What TWO types of coursework are required each month on the part-time course?</span><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">A</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"checkbox\" data-luma-option=\"A\"></span><span>a case study</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">B</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"checkbox\" data-luma-option=\"B\"></span><span>an essay</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">C</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"checkbox\" data-luma-option=\"C\"></span><span>a survey</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">D</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"checkbox\" data-luma-option=\"D\"></span><span>a short report</span></div><div class=\"source-option\"><label class=\"source-option-letter\">E</label><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q24\" data-luma-kind=\"checkbox\" data-luma-option=\"E\"></span><span>a study diary</span></div></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":1},{"id":"en-c5-t1-l-g3-2","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 26-30","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the summary below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</p><p><strong>Modular Courses</strong></p><p>Students study <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">26</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q26\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> during each module. A module takes <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">27</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q27\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and the work is very <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">28</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q28\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> . To get a Diploma each student has to study <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">29</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q29\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and then work on <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">30</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q30\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in depth.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":5}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cambridge-ielts-05-academic-listening-test-1-3.mp3"],"order_index":3},{"id":"en-c5-t1-l-p4","title":"Part 4","part_number":4,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/3172228-cambridge-ielts-05-academic-listening-test-1-4.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-c5-t1-l-g4-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 31-35","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the sentences below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS for each answer.</p><ul><li>According to George Bernard Shaw, men are supposed to understand <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">31</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q31\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> , economics and finance.</li><li>However, women are more prepared to <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">32</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q32\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> about them.</li><li>Women tend to save for <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">33</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q33\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and a house.</li><li>Men tend to save for <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">34</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q34\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> and for retirement.</li><li>Women who are left alone may have to pay for <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">35</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q35\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> when they are old.</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":5},{"id":"en-c5-t1-l-g4-1","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"table_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 36-40","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p>Complete the summary below.</p><p>Write NO MORE THAN THREE WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER for each answer.</p><p><strong>Saving for the future</strong></p><p>Research indicates that many women only think about their financial future when a <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">36</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q36\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> occurs. This is the worst time to make decisions. It is best for women to start thinking about pensions when they are in their <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">37</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q37\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> . A good way for women to develop their <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">38</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q38\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> in dealing with financial affairs would be to attend classes in <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">39</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q39\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> . When investing in stocks and shares, it is suggested that women should put a high proportion of their savings in <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">40</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c5-t1-l-q40\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> . In such ways, women can have a comfortable, independent retirement.</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":5}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cambridge-ielts-05-academic-listening-test-1-4.mp3"],"order_index":4}],"questions":[{"id":"en-c5-t1-l-q1","part_id":"en-c5-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-c5-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"minibus/by minibus/a minibus","correct_answer_variants":["minibus","by minibus","a minibus"],"answerCount":1,"sourceNumbers":[1],"sourceInputName":"ielts_listening_answer_3166818_1","order_index":1,"points":1},{"id":"en-c5-t1-l-q2","part_id":"en-c5-t1-l-p1","group_id":"en-c5-t1-l-g1-0","question_type":"source_text","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","question_text":"","correct_answer":"15/15 people","correct_answer_variants":["15","15 peo